## Average Exam Marks by Gender

```{r}
aggregate(
  Exam_Marks ~ Gender,
  data = student_data,
  FUN = mean
)
```

```{r}
gender_average <- aggregate(
  Exam_Marks ~ Gender,
  data = student_data,
  FUN = mean
)
```

## Average Exam Marks by Gender

```{r}
barplot(
  gender_average$Exam_Marks,
  names.arg = gender_average$Gender,
  main = "Average Exam Marks by Gender",
  xlab = "Gender",
  ylab = "Average Exam Marks"
)
```